  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ecumenical UN Office WCC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Ecumenical UN Office (a joint WCC/ACT office). The office builds relations between the WCC and the UN, enhances the capacity of WCC members and specialised ministries to engage in advocacy towards the UN. Key topics the office seeks to influence the UN on: gender justice including the prevention of early and forced marriage, indigenous peoples&apos; rights, peace-building and just peace.</narrative>
  </description>
